{"lyrics":"[Intro: G Herbo & Juice WRLD]\n[00:01.74](Lil' Mexico, yeah, ayy, yo, Mexico, uh-huh)\n[00:04.98]Motherfucker (Uh, huh-huh)\n[00:06.68]We, we in New York, we just went fresh out of the plane\n[00:09.06]It's 253 on foenem\n[00:09.82](Bitch, huh-huh)\n[00:10.10](Bitch, huh-huh, DJ Victoriouz with me in the building)\n[00:11.72](I got what you want)\n[Verse 1: G Herbo & Juice WRLD]\n[00:12.96]Call me big G Herbo, Swerve for short (Uh-huh, for short)\n[00:15.48]Keep my car in sport (My car in sport)\n[00:17.20]And I ball, yeah, I ball, like I got home court, bitch\n[00:20.22]I'm 'bout family, money, and shit, and that's in that order (In that order)\n[00:23.74]Bought a Rollie, look like my shit been sittin' in that water (In that water)\n[00:27.02]Look at my neck, a quarter milli' (Quart')\n[00:28.72]I'll fuck your wife and daughter, silly (Uh-huh)\n[00:30.30]Throwin' up B's like I'm Billy (Billy)\n[00:32.00]Fire your block up, pop a wheelie, skrrt (Skrrt)\n[00:34.14]Nigga, let's have a money war (Oh)\n[00:37.02]Can't go to work, you ain't got no money (Work)\n[Verse 2: Juice WRLD]\n[00:39.58]Bitch, my money worth (Uh-huh)\n[00:40.88]I earn my stripe like Adidas (Uh-huh)\n[00:42.46]Five-hundred K for a feature (Uh-huh)\n[00:44.00]I probably could fuck on my teacher\n[00:45.68]I hit from the back on the bleachers\n[00:47.26]Yeah, she fucked Swerve (Swerve), fuck-nigga need work (Need work)\n[00:50.38]She suck 'til the knees hurt (She go), big gun with a three burst (Grrah, go)\n[00:53.72]Huh, there he go, shit, grab the heater\n[00:57.80].223s got him hot like a fever\n[01:00.46]Oh my God, I'm her God, she a believer (Uh)\n[01:03.32]Yeah, she go all the way, yeah, set it up, call the play, yeah\n[01:07.04]Thirteen for the Chanel (Woo), she fucked me for that Chanel (Fucked for Chanel)\n[01:10.12]Hundred bands left in the duffel still\n[01:11.64]Get in our way, we shoot to kill\n[01:13.76]I been gettin' buckets, no pails, bitch, I'm rich as hell\n[01:16.92]Let's have a money war, for Benjamin, I kill\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[01:19.88]For Benjamin, I kill, Benjamin, I kill\n[01:23.22]Let's have a money war, Benjamin, I kill\n[01:28.68]Benjamin, I kill, Benjamin, I kill\n[01:29.84]Let's have a money war, Benjamin, I kill\n[Verse 3: G Herbo & Juice WRLD]\n[01:33.58]And for that money, I will (I will)\n[01:35.76]Never committed fuck shit, everything I did for you real (Ayy)\n[01:39.22]Hand on the hood with no deal, for real\n[01:40.74]My niggas been out makin' sales, as well\n[01:42.24]On my dick when I'm pullin' out whips, was ill\n[01:44.04]Only did disappear when shit was real\n[01:45.52]Fuck a nigga, blow his brains out, I'm sick as hell (Uh)\n[01:47.38]This shit could kill, like sick as hell (Uh)\n[01:49.10]Go to sleep, wake up, bricks sell (Uh)\n[01:50.78]Nigga, why you hatin'? I wish you well (Uh)\n[01:52.46]You hustle like me? These niggas hell (Uh)\n[01:54.08]Buy some more 'Woods, these bitches stale (Uh)\n[01:55.64]Eatin' whole lobsters with the tails (Uh)\n[01:57.50]Bitches givin' head out with the tales (Uh-huh)\n[01:59.24]Glowed up, head out, with some L's\n[02:01.66]Get some shells (Uh, baow)\n[02:03.16]Hard bodies with me, all you niggas is frail\n[02:05.90]Niggas got some homi's with me, catch a body or three\n[02:09.38]Like three or four, my niggas got milli's, now we wildin' OT (Ayy)\n[02:12.94]All in the street, we ain't low-key\n[02:14.56]Put a nigga ten, minus four feet (Uh-huh)\n[02:16.02]Heard somebody said \"well no pistols in here\" but my homie disagreed 'cause he know me (Uh)\n[02:19.32]Take an L to the chin, you know me (Uh)\n[02:21.10]But all due is red 'cause it's so easy (Uh-huh)\n[02:22.60]Told Juice, \"Slow down,\" makin' pints disappear, act like he been drinkin' before Weezy (Ayy)\n[Outro: Juice WRLD & G Herbo]\n[02:30.36]Bitch, uh-huh (Bitch, bitch)\n[02:37.12]Uh, huh, huh (Bitch)\n[02:42.70]Uh (Bitch)\n[02:44.52]Bitch\n[02:45.80]Park that bitch up in a garage (Ayy)\n[02:50.80]Park that bitc